  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f72cbdc7aa176194aa3e8747dc128cdf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GooNapped.Runtime::GooNapped.SceneNote
  note: 'LEVEL C3_L04  (chapter 3 = kandidat dipotong kalau molor)

    Target 2-4
    menit. Isi: toples (teman + resep 2-3 ciri), bahan, penjaga, exit.

    Objektif:
    1) intip toples  2) kumpulkan bahan  3) makan sesuai resep  4) belah diri, potongan
    masuk toples, teman ditelan  5) kabur ke exit.

    Desain level/puzzle: tim.
    Implementasi: programmer (+AI).

    Tilemap: Floor (Env_Lit), Walls (collider),
    Decor. Lampu: Light 2D dengan Normal Map Quality = Accurate.'
